1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,833
Ahead, a heavy steel door. Wet on the
outside. Warm to the touch.

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:09,433
Rule three. Touch the door before you
open it. Hot means fire on the other
side.

3
00:00:09,933 --> 00:00:14,167
This one is only warm. Sun on steel.
You open it, and close it behind you.

4
00:00:14,667 --> 00:00:19,333
Always close the doors. A ship doesn't
sink in one second. It sinks one open
door at a time.
